{{also|jit|JIT|JİT}}
==Czech==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|cs|sla-pro|*jьti||to go}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/jiːt/|lang=cs}}
* {{audio|Cs-jít.ogg|audio|lang=cs}}

===Verb===
{{cs-verb|a=i}}

# to [[walk]], [[go]] {{gloss|on foot}}
# to [[work]], [[do]], [[suffice]]
#: {{ux|cs|Budou tři stačit? To '''půjde'''.|Will three be enough? It '''will do'''.}}
#: {{ux|cs|'''Jde''' mi to.|I'm good at this.}}
# to be possible
#: {{ux|cs|'''Nejde''' udělat všechno dobře, ale udělat většinu dobře by už mohlo '''jít'''.}}
# {{lb|cs|with the preposition {{m|cs|o}}}} to [[concern]], [[matter]], [[interest]] {{gloss|to be at issue, to be at stake}}
#: {{ux|cs|'''Jde o''' život.|There's a life at stake.}}
#: {{ux|cs|Právě '''o''' to mi '''jde'''.|That's exactly what I'm concerned about.}}

